OL,3,ANepal observes national day of mourning
OL,4,Afor victims of flash flood disaster
OL,5,
OL,6,FNepalis observed a national day of
OL,7,Fmourning for the victims of the flash
OL,8,Fflood on Monday, lighting candles to
OL,9,Fmark the last day of the traditional
OL,10,F13-day Hindu mourning period.
OL,12,FWhile flags were flown at half mast,
OL,13,Fcommemorations were scaled back as
OL,14,Frescue teams continue to search for
OL,15,Fsurvivors. Candlelight vigils were
OL,16,Fplanned for Monday evening.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,319,300,200,140,0,100
