OL,3,ANepal observes national day of mourning
OL,4,Afor victims of flash flood disaster
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 1,287 people are known to have
OL,7,Fdied after a flash flood, believed to
OL,8,Fhave been triggered by a glacial
OL,9,Fcollapse, swept through villages in a
OL,10,FHimalayan valley along the border
OL,11,Fbetween Nepal and Tibet.
OL,13,FAlmost two weeks later, more than 5,000
OL,14,Fpeople are still missing.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
